<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BREAK ENGLAND'S TEST RUNS RECORD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BREAK ENGLAND'S TEST RUNS RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka broke England's 59-year-old record of the highest innings total in tests when they reached 905 for four during the final session of the first test against India in Colombo on Wednesday.</p>
<p>England scored 903 for seven declared against Australia at the Oval in 1938.</p>
</text>
